        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jefferson Davis, Franklin Pierce, Daniel S. Lamont\n- Roles: United States Secretary of War, President of the Confederate States\n- Organizations: White House of the Confederacy, Provisional Confederate States Constitution\n\nFacts:\n- Franklin Pierce had a United States Secretary of War in his administration.\n- Daniel S. Lamont held the office of United States Secretary of War.\n- Jefferson Davis held the office of United States Secretary of War under Franklin Pierce.\n- Jefferson Davis was the sole President of the White House of the Confederacy.\n- Jefferson Davis was elected President in 1946 under the Provisional Confederate States Constitution.",
